{#
  rosehallgren.se/admin — a memorable door to the editor.

  Pages CMS is a hosted app, and this site is served by GitHub Pages, which
  only serves static files: there is nothing to self-host into /admin. So this
  is a redirect, and it is one page rather than a server rule because Pages
  cannot issue a 301.

  Three ways in, so it works with JS off and with meta-refresh blocked:
  location.replace (no history entry, so Back leaves the site rather than
  bouncing you here again), a meta refresh, and a plain link.

  NOTE the branch: this repo is on master, not main. app.pagescms.org 404s on
  the wrong branch.
#}
{%- set cmsUrl = "https://app.pagescms.org/jonasjohansson-archive/rosehallgren.se/master" %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Edit · Studio Rose Hallgren</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ cmsUrl }}" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url={{ cmsUrl }}" />
    <script>
      location.replace("{{ cmsUrl }}");
    </script>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon/favicon.svg" />
    <style>
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Instrument";
        src: url("/assets/fonts/Instrument.woff2") format("woff2");
        font-weight: 400 700;
        font-display: optional;
      }
      html {
        color-scheme: light;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        background: #eeece8;
        color: #141414;
        font:
          400 1rem/1.5 "Instrument",
          Helvetica,
          Arial,
          sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
      }
      .note {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        opacity: 0.6;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p>Opening the <a href="{{ cmsUrl }}">Studio Rose Hallgren editor</a>…</p>
      <p class="note">
        If nothing happens, follow the link above and sign in with GitHub.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
